   { oecd := .estate, why := "Inheritance, estate and gift taxes: not levied in 2025 (R3 registry, registry/ASIA_PACIFIC.json: none (inheritance exempt from IIT)); grade B, no statute text read for the negative" },
   { oecd := .transactions, why := "4400: no tax on property transfers in 2025. PwC Worldwide Tax Summaries, Kazakhstan (Individual - Other taxes, last reviewed 2 December 2025, Wayback capture 2025-12-16, asiapac/kz/law/pwc_kz_indother_wb20251216.txt: no transfer tax listed) and Deloitte Kazakhstan Highlights 2025 (updated January 2025, asiapac/kz/law/deloitte_kz_2025.txt: no transfer tax; no stand-alone stamp duty, only levies on acts of state bodies); the OECD Revenue Statistics detailed table for Kazakhstan (DSD_REV_ASAP@DF_REVKAZ 2.1, fetched 2026-11-22, asiapac/kz/law/oecd_KAZ.csv) books 0 under 4400 in 2021-2024. state duty for registering rights to immovable property is a fee for a service of a state body (OECD Interpretative Guide §12), not modelled Grade B (guides and official revenue table; no statute read)." }]

def notes : List String := ["KZ P7: 3 cited absences, 0 levied taxes not modelled (C)"]

def unsupported (_ : List String) (_ : CanonGlobal) : List String := []

#guard absent.length == 3

